  "stem": "In quadrilateral \\(ABCD\\) shown, angles \\(A\\) and \\(D\\) are right angles, \\(AB = 14\\), \\(DC = 8\\), and \\(BC = 10\\). What is the area of quadrilateral \\(ABCD\\)?",
